        <mxCell id="9PRBQKjkKrYQVyG5I4b1-20" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Overall Flow (End-to-End)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Task - IT Infra Team&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;2&quot; data-editing-info=&quot;{&amp;quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;orderedStyleType&amp;quot;:1}&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); direction: ltr; list-style: decimal; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: black; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit; direction: ltr;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;Network Layer (firewall / gateway)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;ul data-editing-info=&quot;{&amp;quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&amp;quot;:true}&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); direction: ltr; list-style: disc; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: black; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit; direction: ltr;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;Requests first hit a gateway/firewall/reverse proxy layer.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: black; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit; direction: ltr;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;This layer controls access and routes traffic.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: black; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit; direction: ltr;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;After filtering/routing, requests coming from prod subdomain on ports &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;80 and 443 &lt;/b&gt;are forwarded to: &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;prod-ip:80, 443 respectively&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Task - Application Team&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1. Install JVM (LTS)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2. Install 2 instances of Tomcat server (LTS)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3. Install Nginx and route:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; /gw → route to Prod Tomcat instance (running on port 8686)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;/qa-gw → route to QA Tomcat instance (running on port 8787)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4. Install middleware application.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note:&lt;/b&gt; To perform the installation, application team need access to VM with administrator rights&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="520" width="730" x="660" y="520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
